Vidking Player API
==================

Base URL: https://www.vidking.net

Movie embed
-----------
GET /embed/movie/{tmdbId}

`tmdbId` is the numeric ID from themoviedb.org.

Example:
https://www.vidking.net/embed/movie/533535

TV episode embed
----------------
GET /embed/tv/{tmdbId}/{season}/{episode}

`tmdbId` is the numeric TV show ID from themoviedb.org.
`season` and `episode` are numeric season and episode numbers.

Example:
https://www.vidking.net/embed/tv/1399/1/2

The player is embedded in an iframe:

```tsx
<iframe
  src="https://www.vidking.net/embed/movie/533535"
  allowFullScreen
  allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture"
/>
```

The documented Vidking API supports movies and TV episodes. Anime playback
continues to use the existing anime provider because Vidking does not document
an anime endpoint.
